Z||000011||Cooter||09-13-2000||06:59 PM||||On the way to work this morning, an Excursion (sp?) backed out of a driveway right in front of me. He then proceded to block both lanes so I could not pass until we got to the no passing zone. He then slowed down to 35 MPH in the 45+ zones. He had the "I am bigger than you" attitude with the HUGE mud bog looking tires. People like that should have to ride the school bus everyday for the rest of their lives.||||reg||1
